            "block_label": "table",
            "block_content": "<table><tr><td>Element name</td><td>Type</td><td>Semantics</td></tr><tr><td>PulseSequenceOrder</td><td>complexType:WPT_TxRxPulseOrderTypeSee 8.3.5.6.4.7</td><td>Ordered list of the antenna identifiers, which describes the order with which the transmitters send out a signal as one pulse package.The list defines a pulse package, which contains the ordered collection of pulses from each EV transmitter.For each transmitter this element shall be given once.</td></tr><tr><td>PulseSeparationTime</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedShort</td><td>Time in ms between the individual pulses within the pulse package</td></tr><tr><td>PulseDuration</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedShort</td><td>Time duration in ms of each individual pulse within the pulse package</td></tr><tr><td>PackageSeparationTime</td><td>simpleType:xs:unsignedShort</td><td>Time in ms between two subsequent pulse packages</td></tr></table>",
